error[type-mismatch] 2:21-2:22
  (map (fn [t] (assoc t "severity" "low")) (call tickets.list {:status "open"}))
                      ^
  assoc takes a Map here, but this is a record.
  Expected: Map<String, ...>
  Found: Ticket
  A record has fixed fields. Read one with get: (get r :field).
  Help: sx help assoc
